    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) differential relative growth / Huxley allometry — Model fidelity to source: 62/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Core Huxley law y = b x^k and exponential relative-growth trajectories are implemented with Lean 4 mirror theorems, but the script does not yet expose CLI overrides or piecewise breakpoints discussed in the 1950 Royal Society counterclaim." ;
