<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-008-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) differential relative growth / Huxley allometry — MorphoEval overall 52.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline (54.2/100). Implements log-log OLS fits to digitised Thompson Figs 18–22 CSV tables and a differential-growth animation, but omits parameter-regime sweeps, isometry ablation controls, computer-vision segmentation overlays on vendored specimen photos, and formal KS / CV goodness-of-fit reporting required for full MorphoEval biological-validation. Overall 52.8/100 (faithfulness 48.0, reproducibility 64.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 38, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 48, Source and data traceability 72, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 55. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_008_the_rate_of_growth_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-008_the-rate-of-growth.py at f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4, image/png, 210314 B, 1960×1120 px, artifact_sha256 c0711f11b3b1842157463e9261a8c571d96600fcdda2513a6ec0ffd01d0854af (sha256 c0711f11b3b1842157463e9261a8c571d96600fcdda2513a6ec0ffd01d0854af), spec_fingerprint b37a2dcc1ba621b31fed52cf52f6c5474ec5d50ddbbdb22578110acce07480e1. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b37a2dcc1ba621b31fed52cf52f6c5474ec5d50ddbbdb22578110acce07480e1; artifact_sha256: c0711f11b3b1842157463e9261a8c571d96600fcdda2513a6ec0ffd01d0854af; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-008/pheidole_caste_head_body.csv=ea73fc99f66c404b..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-008/t1917_008_the_rate_of_growth_reference.json=f126962ad37aed1b..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-008/thompson_fig18_brain_body.csv=89125925b63af4a4..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-008/thompson_fig19_heart_body.csv=499c9d07a4584a3d..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-008/thompson_fig22_plaice_length_weight.csv=748df1a60b251b7c..., morphoeval/lean/loops/Thompson1917_T1917_008.lean=4c7e5dc8c58cdc20...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add parameter_regime_sweep panel and isometry k=1 ablation RMSE deltas",
        "remediation needed: Report KS statistic on log residuals and expand measure_morphoeval",
        "remediation needed: Run segment_ant_head_mask on pheidole_megacephala_minor_head.jpg and overlay on figure",
        "remediation needed: Write superseding Pass 2 audit after Step 12" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.28e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

